{"page":471,"verses":[{"verse_key":"40:34","surah":40,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ جَآءَكُمْ يُوسُفُ مِن قَبْلُ بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ فَمَا زِلْتُمْ فِى شَكٍّ مِّمَّا جَآءَكُم بِهِۦ ۖ حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا هَلَكَ قُلْتُمْ لَن يَبْعَثَ ٱللَّهُ مِنۢ بَعْدِهِۦ رَسُولًا ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ يُضِلُّ ٱللَّهُ مَنْ هُوَ مُسْرِفٌ مُّرْتَابٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Joseph came to you before with clear signs, but you never ceased to doubt the message he brought you. When he died, you said, “God will not send another messenger.”’ In this way God leaves the doubting rebels to stray-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَكُمْ","en_gloss":"came to you","transliteration":"jāakum","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُوسُفُ","en_gloss":"Yusuf","transliteration":"yūsufu","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"with clear proofs","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"but not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"زِلْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you ceased","transliteration":"zil'tum","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"شَكٍّۢ","en_gloss":"doubt","transliteration":"shakkin","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّمَّا","en_gloss":"about what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"جَآءَكُم","en_gloss":"he brought to you","transliteration":"jāakum","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"[with it]","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":14,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"40:34"},{"pos"